{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.2020b.q16.material.recovered", "text": "①随着因特网和手机的普及，电子邮件、QQ、微博等软件工具被越来越多的人所接受，成为人们学习工作的交流方式。②本节课涉及的是初中信息技术教材中的《网络交流》一节，内容包括电子邮件、在线及时交流、网络新媒介三部分，通过本节课的学习，学生能够了解电子邮件的相关知识；学生正确书写电子邮件地址的格式，掌握用web方式收发电子邮件方法；体会QQ在群体交流中的作用。学习方法：合作学习教学对象：初中二年级学生，且大多数有QQ聊天经历教学环境：多媒体网络教室教学用时：1课时（45分钟）", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "99cff2fc82960aa0d2714bcde692f3befdf9e7a0802bd2aa0ca32609045900e2", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2517, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2753, "next_source_question_number": 21, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 16, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "99cff2fc82960aa0d2714bcde692f3befdf9e7a0802bd2aa0ca32609045900e2"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.2020b.q16"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.s1.k08", "ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.s2.k02", "ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.s3.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.315.r001", "ntce.outline.315.r007", "ntce.outline.315.r008", "ntce.outline.315.r016", "ntce.outline.315.r017", "ntce.outline.315.r018", "ntce.outline.315.r020"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.2020b.q16"], "word_count": 236, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "xinxi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "99cff2fc82960aa0d2714bcde692f3befdf9e7a0802bd2aa0ca32609045900e2", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2517, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2753, "next_source_question_number": 21, 